  "readme": "🧠 AI-Enable-Blog-Generator\n\nAI-Enable-Blog-Generator is a full-stack web application developed using React.js, Node.js, Express.js, and MongoDB Atlas. It enables admins to securely log in via JWT authentication, create blogs with titles, images, and categories, and manage their publish/unpublish status.\n\nThe app integrates Gemini API for AI-based blog description generation and ImageKit API for seamless image uploads. Users can browse, search, and comment on published blogs in real time.\n\n🚀 Live Demo\n\nhttps://ai-enable-blog-generator.vercel.app\n\n⚙️ Key Libraries Used\n\nFrontend: React.js, Tailwind CSS, Axios, React Router DOM, Quill Editor, React Hot Toast\nBackend: Express.js, Mongoose, JWT, Multer, ImageKit API, Gemini API, Dotenv, CORS\n\nIf You Want to Access AdminPanel -Contact Me i can share Credentials\n",
